  "FuJianTeflonTape is a China PTFE thread seal tape factory supplying yellow gas PTFE tape for B2B wholesale and export orders. This product category is prepared for buyers who need yellow gas pipe thread sealing tape for buyers who need a clear gas line SKU. Instead of retail-style selling, our work is organized around repeat order specifications, carton packing, OEM requirements and clear communication before production.": "泉州机浴 是中国 PTFE 螺纹密封带工厂，为 B2B 批发和出口订单供应黄色燃气 PTFE 生料带。该产品分类适合需要明确燃气管道 SKU 的采购商。我们不是零售式销售，而是围绕复购规格、纸箱包装、OEM 要求和生产前清晰沟通来组织工作。",
