  "We focus on PTFE thread seal tape products for importers, wholesalers, hardware distributors, plumbing suppliers and OEM brand customers. Our work is built around clear specifications, stable packing and practical communication before production.": "我们专注于为进口商、批发商、五金经销商、水暖供应商和 OEM 品牌客户提供 PTFE 螺纹密封带产品。我们的工作围绕清晰规格、稳定包装和生产前实际沟通展开。",
  "Customers can request standard PTFE tape, high density tape, gas pipe thread seal tape, plumbing seal tape, colored tape and custom OEM packaging. We can discuss width, length, thickness, density, tape color, spool color, label, barcode, display box and export carton requirements.": "客户可询价标准 PTFE 生料带、高密度带、燃气管道螺纹密封带、水暖密封带、彩色带和定制 OEM 包装。我们可以讨论宽度、长度、厚度、密度、带子颜色、轮芯颜色、标签、条码、展示盒和出口纸箱要求。",
  "Common SKUs and carton packing for plumbing, hardware and building material channels.": "适用于水暖、五金和建材渠道的常见 SKU 和纸箱包装。",
